# LF normalization for the 20 approved stable files (applied 2026-10-16).
#
# Prettier enforces "endOfLine: lf", but Windows checkouts with
# core.autocrlf=true materialize these files as CRLF, failing
# `pnpm format:check` on content that already matches HEAD. `text eol=lf`
# pins LF for exactly these paths; no other file is affected.
# Verified before applying: CRLF -> LF changes line endings only
# (1,294 CRLF pairs removed; content byte-identical to the committed
# blobs for all 20 files).

